00:10:38.290 --> 00:10:41.240
What about be Superman for a day?

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:43.493
- I wish to drown a man.

00:10:46.405 --> 00:10:49.092
(soft ominous music)

00:10:49.092 --> 00:10:50.090
- What?

00:10:50.090 --> 00:10:52.583
- To drown a man in the bath tub.

00:10:54.010 --> 00:10:58.310
To hold him down while the
last breath escapes his body,

00:10:58.310 --> 00:11:03.135
and then deep in that water,
all the while singing,

00:11:03.135 --> 00:11:08.135
♪ La la la la ♪
(children laughing faintly)

00:11:09.237 --> 00:11:10.070
- Liam!

00:11:11.941 --> 00:11:13.608
- You said anything.

00:11:15.197 --> 00:11:17.900
- Surely we don't want
to hurt other people.

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:20.200
Now do we, kiddo? (chuckles)

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:21.450
(Marion chuckles)

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:22.283
- Anything else?

00:11:22.283 --> 00:11:26.020
Fly in a hot air balloon
or meet a celebrity?

00:11:26.020 --> 00:11:30.350
- My new wish is to lean
over the body of a dying man,

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:34.533
and put my lips on his,
stealing his last breath.

00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:37.360
- [Doctor] Liam!

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:39.237
- No one will get hurt.

00:11:39.237 --> 00:11:40.640
- No, absolutely not.

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:42.890
I don't even know where you...

00:11:42.890 --> 00:11:47.890
- I wish to take all the
prostetic legs in the hospital

00:11:48.420 --> 00:11:53.420
and bind them together with
the dried flesh of the dead,

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:58.900
into a webbed, massive creature.

00:11:59.070 --> 00:11:59.903
- Liam!

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:03.320
- I am so sorry, Ms. Glass.

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:06.070
- It's all right. He doesn't
know what he's saying.

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:07.754
- I wish to pee in your mouth.

00:12:07.754 --> 00:12:08.587
- What?!

00:12:08.587 --> 00:12:09.810
- Both of you.

00:12:09.810 --> 00:12:10.790
- Mine?

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:12.240
- Especially you.

00:12:12.240 --> 00:12:13.073
- Oh.

00:12:13.073 --> 00:12:17.840
- I wish to pee in both of your
mouths as I stand over you.

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:20.414
I'll need a glass of water and 10 minutes.

00:12:20.414 --> 00:12:21.580
- Enough, you little (beep)!

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:23.040
- Dr. Gupta!

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:23.933
- No!

00:12:23.933 --> 00:12:26.120
You are reprehensible!

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:27.003
You are evil!

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:29.901
You are a devil child!

00:12:29.901 --> 00:12:31.210
(Liam sobs)

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:34.630
- Dr. Gupta, he's not a devil
child! He's just a child!

00:12:34.630 --> 00:12:37.160
You have no business
working in a pediatric ward!

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:39.004
- What?
- I'm going to report you!

00:12:39.004 --> 00:12:41.104
(Liam sobs)

00:12:41.104 --> 00:12:45.452
(door slams)
(Liam sings softly)

00:12:45.452 --> 00:12:48.910
♪ Shame on you Gupta ♪

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:51.993
♪ Shame on you Gupta ♪

00:12:53.530 --> 00:12:55.863
You really upset Marion Glass.

00:12:57.811 --> 00:12:59.228
- This is insane.

00:13:02.088 --> 00:13:03.850
You've made me question everything

00:13:03.850 --> 00:13:08.110
that I've ever believed
about the essential goodness

00:13:08.110 --> 00:13:08.943
of children.

00:13:10.124 --> 00:13:15.124
- Wish granted.
(monitor flatlines and beeps)

00:13:16.832 --> 00:13:19.499
- (gasps) Liam!

00:13:31.562 --> 00:13:33.619
(Liam giggles)

00:13:33.619 --> 00:13:35.077
I am dying now.

00:13:35.077 --> 00:13:38.577
(machine resumes beeping)

00:13:39.780 --> 00:13:42.530
(cheerful music)

00:13:45.143 --> 00:13:46.991
♪ I want you ♪

00:13:46.991 --> 00:13:48.920
♪ But I don't need you ♪

